  "passage": "Last week, I travelled to a small village in the countryside for a holiday. It was a single journey with my parents, and we stayed in a cosy hotel. On the first day, we tried the local food, including a delicious chicken dish that was cooked in a special way. The weather was quite warm, so I packed light clothes like a cotton blouse with short sleeves. Unfortunately, I was unable to wear it because it was too hot, and I had to reduce my time outdoors. The village is famous for its history; it's said that a local farmer invented a clever tool for farming many years ago. The holiday involved lots of walking and visiting old buildings, which was tiring but fun. We also took many photos to remember the trip.",
